# Chapter 4 "Sauce Samouraï" (21:00-23:40, night): data/chapters.json chapter 4, docs/DESIGN.md §3.5.
# V2-26:
#  - rue Pasteur's east end at 21:00: Cristina and Joaquin; "You're C.?" / "You're M.?"; the proof (the left one, the
#    same M, the same chewed stem); Joaquin's orders (scripts/minigames/kebab.gd); Cristina's pocket is empty;
#  - the finder now says the Under, 20:31; back there during the BDE's sound check, Cristina following;
#  - the sound search (scripts/minigames/findmy.gd): the AirPod is in the sofa; found; ten seconds of stereo;
#    Cristina's sincere beat;
#  - Anisha's SOS lands on top of the music: Mano puts both AirPods in the case (the turn);
#  - "1, 2, 3, ACU!" (scripts/minigames/soleil.gd): the kebab past ACU Léo into SM14; a cut to 23:05; the night
#    moulinette (moulinette.gd, night=true), OK at 23:38; Anisha's sincere beat; "The steps. Now.";
#  - back at the steps (the KB1 stairs sit-down on the way, optional), `$ chapter 5`.
# The kebab itself is never shown. [slot]: a line written in a friend's own voice, which the friend reviewed.
# Pronouns: Mano he, Ishita she, Toma they; everyone else by name.

# Rue Pasteur's east end, 21:00 (the chapter's start cue, with Cristina; Joaquin beside her)
~ c4.meet
think: 21:00. Joaquin. And someone with C.'s ink on her hand.
joaquin: [#neutral] 21:00. You're early. I've updated the model. [slot]
mano: [#smile] You're C.?
cristina: [#grin] You're M.? [slot]
mano: The AirPod guy. Yes. Hi. Sorry. Hi.
cristina: [#smile] Hi! Cristina. Toma's friend. I've chased you since six. [slot]
$ set met_cristina
cristina: [#smile] "M is me. Thank you so much." I believed you. [if reply_cristina == "sorry"] [slot]
cristina: [#smirk] You promised to chew the other one. I'm watching. [if reply_cristina == "joke"] [slot]
cristina: You never answered. I came anyway. I'm stubborn. [if reply_cristina == ""] [slot]
cristina: Proof first, though. The other one, please. [slot]
think: The left one. M scratched on it, chewed stem. Not my proudest proof.
mano: Exhibit A. One M. Some teeth marks.
cristina: [#grin] They match. Okay, it's definitely yours. [slot]
joaquin: Before the handover: orders. Toma wants food on the steps. [slot]
joaquin: [#smirk] I'm the captain. You're the memory. Cristina's the witness. [slot]
cristina: [#shock] I'm the witness?
joaquin: Every kebab needs a witness. [slot]
think: The kebab is round the corner. Joaquin is already walking.
$ minigame kebab win=c4.kebab_done lose=c4.kebab_done with=joaquin

# Joaquin's orders again (talk.joaquin while they are not in: a Continue in the middle of them)
~ c4.orders_again
joaquin: [#neutral] Orders. From the top. You're still the memory. [slot]
$ minigame kebab win=c4.kebab_done lose=c4.kebab_done with=joaquin

~ c4.kebab_done
think: [#tired] Eight kebabs. One bag. My arms are a restaurant now.
if kebab_score >= kebab_total
	joaquin: [#grin] Every order right. I'm framing the receipt. [slot]
else
	joaquin: [#neutral] {{kebab_score}} out of {{kebab_total}}. The rest is a surprise. [slot]
	cristina: [#smirk] I witnessed everything. I'm saying nothing. [slot]
$ set kebab_done
joaquin: Can I say something? I don't really do group things. [slot]
joaquin: This one's loud. And it's okay. I checked. [slot]
joaquin: [#smile] I'm glad I came. Don't make it weird. [slot]
mano: [#smile] Too late. It's weird. Welcome.
$ set joaquin_beat
cristina: [#smile] Okay. The handover. Finally. [slot]
think: Her jacket pocket. The left one. Then the right one. Then the left one again.
cristina: [#shock] It was RIGHT HERE.
cristina: [#shock] I had it in the Under. On the sofa, waiting for you. [slot]
mano: [#shock] The finder. The finder app.
$ phone finder under "20:31"
$ phone open find
mano: [#shock] "Last seen: the Under, 20:31."
cristina: [#sad] 20:31. I was on the sofa, with the tape. I'm so sorry. [slot]
joaquin: [#neutral] Statistically, it's in the sofa. Sofas eat things. [slot]
joaquin: I'll take the food to the steps. You two, go. [slot]
think: Except Anisha's kebab. That one stays in my bag.
mano: Third time in the Under tonight. It's basically my flat.
$ set pocket_empty
$ clock 21:20
$ follow cristina
$ clue "Cristina had my AirPod in the Under at 20:31. It's not lost. It's down there, and it can ring."

# The Under, during the BDE's sound check (main trigger inside its door, Cristina beside Mano)
~ c4.search
think: The sound check. Thump. Thump. Karim, on the mic: "un, deux. Un, deux."
cristina: [#smile] Your phone can make it ring. Find, then "Play sound". [slot]
mano: Ten per cent. Five rings, maybe. Then it dies.
cristina: Ring it between the thumps. And listen. [slot]
$ set searching
$ minigame findmy win=c4.found lose=c4.found with=cristina

# Talking to Cristina again while the search is on (a Continue in the middle of it, say): the search again
~ c4.search_again
cristina: [#smile] Between the thumps. It's here somewhere. [slot]
$ minigame findmy win=c4.found lose=c4.found with=cristina

# The sofa (with Cristina): found; stereo; her sincere beat; Anisha's SOS; the case
~ c4.found
$ place mano findmy_mano
$ place cristina findmy_cristina
$ shot findmy_sofa
think: [#shock] Between the cushions, next to the fossilised chip. White. M. Chewed.
mano: [#grin] FOUND IT. Found it found it found it.
cristina: [#grin] YES. Finally! The sofa gives things back! [slot]
$ set found
$ set searching = false
$ shot clear
$ give_airpod
$ sfx fanfare
$ banner "Stereo" "two ears. for once."
$ song explore 8
think: Both ears. There's a whole guitar in this song I've never heard.
cristina: Can I say why I kept chasing you? It's a bit silly. [slot]
cristina: I lost one once. Nobody ever found it. [slot]
cristina: [#sad] I didn't want that to happen to anyone else. That's all. [slot]
mano: You chased a stranger's chewed AirPod all evening.
cristina: [#smile] You're not a stranger now. You're M. [slot]
cristina: [#grin] Also, the teeth marks were very distinctive. [slot]
$ set cristina_beat
$ toast "Cristina will remember that." tick
$ clock 21:47
$ phone flood sos
think: [#shock] My phone. Anisha.
$ phone open anisha
mano: [#shock] "KO. Exercise five. Deadline 23:42. Starving. Help."
think: Music in both ears. Or a friend in SM14, starving, with a deadline.
mano: [#smile] ...Okay. Case.
$ airpods case
think: Click. Both in the case. The world's back, all of it.
$ set anisha_sos
cristina: [#smile] Go. I'll tell the steps you're coming. [slot]
$ unfollow cristina
$ clue "Both AirPods in the case. Anisha: KO, starving, deadline 23:42. Her kebab is in my bag."

# SM14, ACU Léo on night patrol (main trigger at SM14's door: Mano and Léo on their marks)
~ c4.acu
$ shot soleil_wide
think: SM14. ACU Léo, on night patrol. And the rule: no food in the computer rooms.
acu: [#smirk] I can smell a kebab from the corridor. I'm a professional.
think: He counts, I move. He turns, I freeze. Like the playground game.
think: Un, deux, trois... ACU.
$ minigame soleil win=c4.smuggled lose=c4.smuggled with=anisha

# At Anisha's desk, the kebab delivered (with Anisha)
~ c4.smuggled
$ set smuggled
anisha: [#shock] Is that a kebab? In SM14? Past Léo?
mano: [#smile] Galette, harissa, frites. Toma ordered it for you.
anisha: [#smile] You're my favourite person in this building. Right now. [slot]
anisha: [#tired] Exercise five still says KO. Help me? One last time? [slot]
- Sit down and help
	think: One function. Coding style, this time. This could take a while.
	$ time late fade=1.4
	$ clock 23:05
	think: 23:05. An hour of debugging. Mercifully, off camera.
	anisha: [#tired] Last run. Coding style. If it's KO, I'm moving to the Under. [slot]
	$ minigame moulinette sit_at=pcSeat night=true win=c4.mouli_ok lose=c4.mouli_ok with=anisha

~ c4.mouli_ok
$ clock 23:38
think: 23:38. MOULINETTE: OK.
anisha: [#shock] OK. It says OK. Four minutes early. [slot]
anisha: [#grin] I'm never doing that again. [slot]
think: She's doing that again.
anisha: Can I say something? Not about code. [slot]
anisha: Deadline nights used to be me and a screen. [slot]
anisha: Tonight someone smuggled a kebab past the ACU. [slot]
anisha: [#smile] For someone with one ear in, you showed up. [slot]
mano: Tonight it's zero ears. They're both in the case.
anisha: [#grin] Best zero ever. [slot]
$ set anisha_beat
$ set mouli_night
$ toast "Anisha will remember that." tick
$ phone flood late
anisha: [#smirk] The steps. Now. Toma's going to kill us. Go, I'll push and run. [slot]
$ clue "MOULINETTE: OK at 23:38. Now the steps, before Toma kills us."

# Back at the steps (main trigger once the moulinette is OK): the chapter 5 card
~ c4.end
think: The steps. Fairy lights, a bag of kebabs, and Toma checking the time.
$ set c4_done
$ chapter 5

# Thoughts on the way (bark triggers)
~ c4.think_court
think: Fairy lights above, and the bass coming up through the ground.

~ c4.think_street
think: A kebab in a bag, at 22:00, on rue Pasteur. I smell like a decision.

~ c4.think_late
think: 23:40. The steps are right there. So is everyone.
